  "details": "SDK version VCC: Base 3.1.10, Worlds 3.1.10\n\nWhen dragging both the Video player prefabs [Unity and AVPRO] (Located on Packages> VRChat >SDK-Worlds> Samples> UdonExampleScene > Prefab> VideoPlayers) into the scene, they will be missing a few things to make the videoplayer work. On the \"VRCURL Input Field\" component it is missing: Text component, Placeholder, and the On End Edit (String) Function. Users will manually have to edit this settings. Making it difficult for some users to set it up.",
